    "chapter": "Spells",
    "section": "7.25",
    "heading": "Saving Throws",
    "lineStart": 6401,
    "lineEnd": 6405
  },
  "section": "7.25",
  "rulesText": "Many spells specify that a target makes a saving throw to avoid some or all of a spell's effects. The spell specifies the ability that the target uses for the save and what happens on a success or failure. Here's how to calculate the DC for your spells:\n\nSpell save DC = 8 + your spellcasting ability modifier + your Proficiency Bonus"
}
